    "attributes": {
        "action": "Withdraw from the UN due to UN Commission findings against Israel in Gaza ",
        "additional_details": "We believe the UN Commission of Inquiry reporting that Israel deliberately kills children evokes the most vile antisemitic tropes of the Middle Ages and UK taxpayers should not be funding the UN.",
        "background": "The UN Independent International Commission of Inquiry on the Occupied Palestinian Territory, including East Jerusalem, and Israel issued a report on 18 June 2026 accusing Israel of deliberately killing children in Gaza. Therefore, we feel the UK must withdraw from the UN.",
